export const tracks={piano:'钢琴',guitar:'吉他',violin:'小提琴',bass:'贝斯',drums:'鼓点',melody:'电子旋律',harmony:'氛围和声'};
const clamp=(v,a,b,f)=>typeof v==='number'&&Number.isFinite(v)?Math.max(a,Math.min(b,v)):f;
export function normalizeMix(value){const result={};for(const k of Object.keys(tracks)){const p=value?.[k]||{},start=clamp(p.start,0,.95,0);result[k]={start,end:clamp(p.end,start+.05,1,1),volume:clamp(p.volume,0,1.5,1)}}return result}
export function gainAt(mix,time,duration){const {start,end,volume}=mix,a=start*duration,b=end*duration;if(time<a||time>=b)return 0;const fade=Math.min(.15,(b-a)/4);return volume*Math.min(1,start>0?(time-a)/fade:1,end<1?(b-time)/fade:1)}
export function gainPoints(mix,duration){const a=mix.start*duration,b=mix.end*duration,fade=Math.min(.15,(b-a)/4);return [[0,mix.start>0?0:mix.volume],...(mix.start>0?[[a,0],[a+fade,mix.volume]]:[]),...(mix.end<1?[[b-fade,mix.volume],[b,0]]:[]),[duration,mix.end<1?0:mix.volume]]}
export function arrangementPreset(kind,enabled){const mix=normalizeMix();if(kind==='build'){for(const k of Object.keys(mix))mix[k].start=({piano:0,guitar:.18,violin:.52,bass:.22,drums:.35,melody:0,harmony:0})[k];mix.harmony.volume=.65}else if(kind==='dialogue'){mix.piano.end=.53;mix.guitar.start=.45;mix.violin.start=.74;mix.melody.end=.5;mix.harmony.volume=.55;mix.drums.start=.5}else if(kind==='intimate'){mix.drums.volume=.35;mix.bass.volume=.6;mix.harmony.volume=.45;mix.violin.start=.65;mix.guitar.volume=.7}return mix}
